name: sim.setObjectChildPose
description: Can be used to set a spherical joint's rotational transformation (the translational part is ignored)
luaSynopsis: sim.setObjectChildPose(int objectHandle, list pose)
pythonSynopsis: sim.setObjectChildPose(int objectHandle, float[7] pose)
inputs:
1. objectHandle: handle of the object
2. pose: the pose (array of 7 values [x y z qx qy qz qw])
outputs:
replacedBy:
- name: joint.quaternion, class: joint, file: joint_joint_quaternion.property
